[en.DECISION_C13_AMBUSH]
Ambush the Empire Forces

[en.DECISION_C13_AMBUSH_desc]
The Equestria Empire is sending forces here without any consent from us. We should teach them a lesson.
Well, they wouldn’t know who did it anyway.

[zh.DECISION_C13_AMBUSH]
伏击帝国军队

[zh.DECISION_C13_AMBUSH_desc]
小马利亚帝国派遣军队来到这里，而我们并没有同意。我们应该给他们一个教训。
反正，他们也不会知道是谁干的。
